{"id":"n72574-5-9","stage":1,"title":"어른 · 令尊","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72574-5-9-1","ko":"어른께서는 자네의 이 문제를 알고 계신 것인가?","zh":"长辈知道你的这个问题吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어른께서는","meaning":"令尊","explanation":"어른：令尊；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"어른","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72574","senseId":"5","lemma":"어른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자네의","meaning":"你","explanation":"자네：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"자네","audio":"/audio/aa7a1b1564db7cda8172.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70797","senseId":"1","lemma":"자네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문제를","meaning":"问题","explanation":"문제：问题；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"4","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알고","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계신","meaning":"(尊称)在。表示前面所述的状态正在持续。","explanation":"계시다：(尊称)在。表示前面所述的状态正在持续。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"계시다","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61346","senseId":"2","lemma":"계시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것인가?","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"00bcc9cf30903659","term":"어른","zh":"令尊","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3","entryId":"72574","definition":"(敬语)别人的父亲。","pronunciation":["어ː른"]},{"id":"aa7a1b1564db7cda","term":"자네","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/aa7a1b1564db7cda8172.mp3","entryId":"70797","definition":"(敬语)听者为朋友或晚辈时用来指称听者。","pronunciation":["자네"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"麻烦的事情或事端。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"e0bef9809d26f11e","term":"계시다","zh":"(尊称)在。表示前面所述的状态正在持续。","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3","entryId":"61346","definition":"(尊称)在。表示前面所述的状态正在持续。","pronunciation":["계ː시다","게ː시다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]}],"audio":"/audio/a7002d51fecbc07b356b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72574-5-9-2","ko":"아니요. 아직 저희 아버지께는 말씀드리지 못했습니다.","zh":"不知道。我还没来得及告诉我父亲。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저희","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"2","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아버지께는","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；께：에게 的敬语形式，表示“给、向、对”某位受尊敬的人。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말씀드리지","meaning":"话；致，道","explanation":"말씀：话；드리다：致，道；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"},{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27365","senseId":"2","lemma":"말씀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"2","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못했습니다.","meaning":"没能","explanation":"못하다：没能；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26838","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저희","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3","entryId":"71231","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对比自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["저히"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"9fa325aa12d3fdd0","term":"말씀","zh":"话","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3","entryId":"27365","definition":"(谦词)自己的言语。","pronunciation":["말ː씀"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，道","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"向上级或年长者说话或打招呼。","pronunciation":["드리다"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"没能","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"26838","definition":"表示之前的话所指的行动未能达成或没有做该事的能力。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/27b1d52ecaa91fefb188.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.693,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72574","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"5","sourceLevel":"초급","day":46,"sequenceScore":2.0935,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["长辈知道你的这个问题吗？","不知道。我还没来得及告诉我父亲。","街上怎么有这么多人啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["长辈知道你的这个问题吗？","不知道。我还没来得及告诉我父亲。","街上怎么有这么多人啊？"],"answer":1}]}
